# CLAUDE.md — AGI Race V2 project (example)

## gstack
Skills are installed in ~/.claude/skills/gstack. Use /office-hours and
/plan-ceo-review before any new video brief, /plan-eng-review before building,
/review after building, /retro after the analytics come back. Use /browse from
gstack for all web browsing.

## HyperFrames — non-negotiable rules
1. Route through /hyperframes first. Motion pieces under ~10 s -> /motion-graphics;
   multi-scene videos -> /general-video.
2. Run `npx hyperframes doctor` and read the timeline before designing.
3. Search the catalog before building any named element.
4. Seek-safe: every state must be correct at any directly-sought time.
   No wall-clock counters, no Web Audio graphs, no conflicting second fromTo.
5. Holds over ~4 s: one monotonic micro-motion (e.g. scale 1 -> 1.008), never a loop.
6. Critical typography in the centre third (must survive 9:16).
7. Verify: lint -> check -> snapshot -> render -> ffprobe; then describe the contact sheet.

## Project rules
- source/ and analysis/ are read-only.
- Characters are named by role, never by real name.
- Never upload. Stop after renders + QA report.
- Report only numbers measured from rendered files.
